	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "Azw_EDpqTd0hYdhz4",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 27, DX 12, IQ 12, HT 14, HP 27, WILL 14, PER 12, FP 14, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 7, DODGE 10, DR 5. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A7qOf7EB5GQ4-EDKc",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 83 (offense 48, protection 35), threat tier major, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AEQPWrzvpNSvFH5aU",
			"text": "Fear Aura: The gelugon can take a Ready maneuver to project an aura of fear. Everyone within 10 yards of the gelugon must roll an immediate Fright Check (p. B360). If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this gelugon’s Fear Aura for one hour."
		},
